---
title: Nairobi County Youth Network Endorses Bill Llia for Governor
publishedDate: 2026-03-28
source: Nairobi County Youth Network
sourceUrl: https://example.com/youth-endorsement
excerpt: The Nairobi County Youth Network, representing over 50 youth organizations, has endorsed Dr. Bill Llia for Governor, citing his commitment to youth employment and skills development.
---

The Nairobi County Youth Network (NCYN), a coalition of more than 50 youth-led organizations, today announced their endorsement of Dr. Bill Llia for Governor of Nairobi County.

In a statement, the network cited Llia's detailed plan for youth employment and skills development as a key factor in their decision.

"Bill Llia is the only candidate who has presented a concrete, funded plan to address youth unemployment," said NCYN chairperson Mohammed Hassan. "His proposal for a county-wide skills training and enterprise program will create real opportunities for thousands of young people."

The endorsement is expected to boost Llia's campaign among young voters, who make up a significant portion of the electorate in Nairobi County.

"This endorsement is not about politics — it is about the future of our youth," Llia said in response. "I am honored to have the trust of these organizations, and I will work every day to earn it."
